const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先限定协议、链与历史窗口",en:"Fix the protocol, chain and historical window"},body:{zh:"文章研究以太坊主市场Aave V2在2020年12月至2022年7月中旬的交易。这个窗口早于后续若干协议与网络变化。把结果写成所有DeFi用户的长期行为规律，会同时扩大链、版本和时间范围，超出原样本支持。",en:"The study examines Aave V2's Ethereum main market from December 2020 to mid-July 2022. The window precedes later protocol and network changes. Presenting the findings as a permanent rule for all DeFi users expands the chain, version and time scope beyond the sample."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §1–2",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"提供资金与借入资产是不同选择",en:"Supplying funds and borrowing assets are distinct decisions"},body:{zh:"作者分别讨论存入资金和借入代币的动机，包括收益机会、杠杆需求与治理相关活动。两侧面对的资产、成本和约束不同。即使发生在同一个地址，也不能把一次存入与一次借入视作同一经济行为或自动归为相同动机。",en:"The paper considers supply and borrowing motives separately, including yields, leverage and governance-related activity. The two sides face different assets, costs and constraints. Even for one address, a deposit and a borrow are not the same economic decision or evidence of an identical motive."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §1; §2",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §1; §2"}}},{title:{zh:"笔数、金额和未偿余额不同",en:"Counts, transaction amounts and outstanding balances differ"},body:{zh:"图3分别按交易笔数和换算为美元的交易金额展示代币分布，因此同一代币在两种图中的份额可能不同。这些是期间发生的交易，不是某一天的未偿余额或锁仓量。比较协议规模前，应先说明衡量的是流量还是存量。",en:"Figure 3 separates transaction counts from USD transaction amounts, so a token's shares can differ across panels. These are flows during a period, not a day's outstanding balance or total value locked. Define flow versus stock before comparing protocol scale."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §2 · figure 3",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §2 · figure 3"}}},{title:{zh:"日借款需求保留用户与资产维度",en:"Daily borrowing retains user and reserve identities"},body:{zh:"论文把某一天同一用户、同一储备资产的借款交易加总为借款需求。合并到协议总量会丢掉用户和代币间差异；以地址数替代借款金额，也会变成另一个指标。编辑建议保留聚合键、代币单位、换算价格和日期边界。",en:"Borrowing demand sums transactions for a user and reserve asset within a day. Protocol totals discard user and token differences, while address counts measure something else. Editorial application: preserve aggregation keys, token units, conversion prices and day boundaries."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §2 · p. 10",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §2 · p. 10"}}},{title:{zh:"治理标记是代理变量，不是动机证明",en:"Governance indicators are proxies, not proof of intent"},body:{zh:"作者区分赋予投票权的治理代币，并利用Snapshot中的投票日历标记投票期间。这让治理活动与借款之间的关系可以被研究，但并不直接说明每一笔借款都是为投票而发生。其他共同变化或地址用途仍可能影响解释。",en:"Governance tokens are flagged by voting rights, and voting periods are identified using Snapshot calendars. This supports studying a relation between governance activity and borrowing. It does not establish that every loan was taken to vote; other co-movements and address uses remain relevant."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §2 · p. 10",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §2 · p. 10"}}},{title:{zh:"市场参照不是单一交易所的替身",en:"Market reference series are not a single-venue substitute"},body:{zh:"文中ETH永续资金费率是七家交易所的简单平均，传统国债利率在非交易日沿用最近交易日数值。两种对齐规则都影响解释。仅有Binance序列不能声称取得了论文输入，资金费率本身也不是Aave借款利率或链上借贷活动。",en:"The ETH funding reference averages seven exchanges, while Treasury yields carry the latest trading-day value across closures. Both alignment rules matter. A Binance series alone is not the paper's input, and perpetual funding is neither the Aave borrowing rate nor on-chain lending activity."},reference:{url:"https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1183-why-defi-lending-evidence-aave-v2.pdf",label:{zh:"2024年7月BIS版 · §2 · pp. 9–10",en:"July 2024 BIS edition · §2 · pp. 9–10"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"研究样本是以太坊上的Aave V2历史活动，不能代表所有链、协议版本或当前用户。借贷与治理动机通过观测变量讨论，不等于识别了每个地址的真实目的。",en:"The sample concerns historical Aave V2 activity on Ethereum, not every chain, version or current user. Observable variables inform lending and governance interpretations; they do not reveal each address's true intent."}};export{e as default};
